{
  "version": 2,
  "title": "Final-pass short tense conjugations (token densifiers)",
  "notes": [
    "Part of B final token-reduction pass (with ZH densifiers / DE compounds).",
    "Prefer short live Romance (es/fr/pt) / nl / el conjugations over stacked EN auxiliaries when meaning stays clear.",
    "Only forms that beat the English source on estimate_tokens are listed; runtime picks cheapest (token→utf8→len).",
    "EN contractions (I'll) remain C; this bank is B final-pass only — not a C ledger.",
    "複合名詞 / compounds here are just another candidate class for cheapest tokens (incl. adj+noun when they win), not a noun-only policy.",
    "Dropped go-fut-fr (je vais) — always loses to iré under cheapest.",
    "I was≠fui (ambiguous with I went); keep EN for I was / map only I went→fui.",
    "Classical Latin conjugations (ibo/ivi/sum…) skipped — prefer surviving modern Romance / live Latin-derived abbrevs (e.g./i.e./etc. stay C).",
    "Progressive *going is not applied when followed by 'to' (going-to future guard in apply_es_fr_tense / _apply_phrase_pairs).",
    "Explicit going-to phrases (I am going to go → iré/vou/…) registered as longer sources.",
    "Tranche2 1s (~35): take/think/try/find/call/put/bring/write/read/buy/wait/use/open/pay/live/send/stay; skip tell≃say, make≃do, get, ask (pedir/preguntar shaky).",
    "`to`/`lang` は runtime cheapest（token→utf8→len）の実勝者に合わせた名目ラベル。勝者は常に runtime が決める（el πάρω/βρω/πάω/μένω 等が勝つ行あり）。",
    "from の主語+助動詞（I will/I'll, I would/I'd, we will/we'll, I am/I'm …）は loader が双方向に自動派生（_subject_aux_variants）。JSON に両形を書く必要はない。",
    "Progressive (be + -ing) は単純時制に落とさない: 進行相を保つ迂言形（es estar+gerundio / pt estar+gerúndio・estar a+inf / it stare+gerundio / fr être en train de / nl aan het）のみ候補とし、token と utf8 が共に縮まなければ EN のまま（tense_matrix が担当）。",
    "英語同綴ガード: 候補のどれかのトークンが英単語と同綴（fixtures/en_wordlist.txt; he/ha/van/fora/a …）なら runtime で除外し、次に安い一意な候補、なければ EN を残す（揺らぎ回避）。`to` はガード後の runtime 勝者。"
  ],
